      "role": "user",
      "content": "the helpline stuff... i know. i just feel like it's all just bandaids on a wound that's never gonna heal. it’s not even that i’m \"in crisis,\" it’s just that this is my life now. i spend every day watching him fade away, and i feel like i'm fading with him. like we're both just waiting for the clock to run out. it feels like there's nothing left for me after this is over. just a big, quiet nothing.",
